# This file requests reviewers. It does not require them, and it cannot:
# the rule that a frozen-core change needs two approving reviews lives in
# the repository host's branch-protection settings, and only a repository
# admin can put it there. checks/kernel-governance.mjs asserts the host
# policy by querying the host, precisely so that the presence of this file
# is never mistaken for the rule being in force.

# The frozen core: canonicalization, sign/verify, chain append/verify, and
# tree construction and proofs. Everything a subtle bug here would be
# unrecoverable in.
